  "sections": [
    {
      "name": "Verse 1",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Cm]O Lord my [Bb]God! when I in awesome [F7]wonder",
        "[Eb/Bb]Consider all the works Thy [Bb]hands have [Dm/A]made,",
        "[F7]I see the [Bb/F]stars, I hear the mighty [F7]thunder,",
        "[Eb/Bb]Thy pow'r thro'out the universe [Dm/A]displayed.",
        "[F7]Then sings [Dm/F]my [Bb/F]soul, my Saviour God [Eb]to Thee;",
        "[Eb/Bb]How great Thou art, [Bb]how great Thou art!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Refrain",
      "type": "chorus",
      "lines": [
        "[F]Then sings my soul",
        "[F7]My Saviour God to [Dm/F]Thee",
        "[Bb/F]How great Thou art",
        "[Bb]How great [Eb]Thou art",
        "[Eb/Bb]Then sings my [Bb]soul",
        "[Bb]My Saviour God to Thee",
        "[Bb]How great [Cm]Thou art",
        "[Cm]How great Thou art"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Cm]When [Bb]through the woods",
        "[Eb/Bb]And forest glades I [Bb/F]wander",
        "[F7]And hear [Bb/F]the birds sing sweetly in [F7]the trees",
        "[Eb/Bb]When I look [Bb/F]down",
        "[F7]From lofty [Bb]mountain grandeur",
        "[Eb/Bb]And see the brook and [Bb]feel the gentle breeze"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Cm]And [Bb]when I think",
        "[Eb/Bb]That God His Son not [Bb]sparing",
        "[F7]Sent Him [Bb/F]to die I scarce can take [F7]it in",
        "[Eb/Bb]That on the [Bb/F]Cross",
        "[F7]My burden [Bb]gladly bearing",
        "[Eb/Bb]He bled and died to [Bb]take away my sin."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 4",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[Cm]When [Bb]Christ shall come",
        "[Eb/Bb]With shouts of acclamation",
        "[Eb/Bb]And take me [Bb/F]home",
        "[F7]What joy [Bb/F]shall fill my [F7]heart",
        "[Eb/Bb]Then I shall [Bb/F]bow",
        "[F7]In humble [Bb]adoration",
        "[F7]And [Dm/F]then [Bb]proclaim",
        "[Eb/Bb]\"My God, how [Bb]great Thou art!\""
      ]
    }
  ],
  "meter": "12.10.11.8.10.8"
